{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th シングルもBuddiesの皆さんにたっくさん楽しんでいただけるように、みんなで頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しずつ、詳細が発表されていますね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケットアートワーク、個人ソロアーティスト写真"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みていただけましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても素敵で、皆さんに届くのが楽しみでした　♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も綺麗な制服に力をかりながら、いろんな場所で頑張れたらと思います　❕"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZUJAIb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZOBJs5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobE7ZUxZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXsG4G1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobD4R3DR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob4bUrgy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黒衣装と白衣装"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪は大人っぽく巻いてもらいました　　♪"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アクセサリーがすこし見えるのがポイントです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobX1fSs6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobohY07k.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くまさん、どうしてそこにいるの"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobGZY3Sd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobct1zYk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よくお喋りしてくれます　かわいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『コインランドリー』のMVが公開されました　🎠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人的には、サビの歌詞とメロディーが大好きで今のタイミングでこの楽曲に出会えたことが嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いろんな思いを全て閉じ込めて静かに一歩を踏み出すようなこの楽曲を、パフォーマンスや日々の姿勢で体現できる期間にできたらいいです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobmPeIh5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うれしいことをいってくれました☺︎"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『Lonesome rabbit』のMVはこちら❗️❗️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "▶︎https://youtu.be/4HfAH746QJo"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱいみてます　^‿^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルの目標は、私のことを応援してくださる皆さんをいっぱい笑顔にすること！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私自身も楽しみながら頑張るので、楽しく応援していただけたら嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th シングル期間もよろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたにいいことばっかりありますように🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづより"}], "source": "official"}